+  // yvvyee: proxy upgrade (VTM_NNINTERP_PROXY=1). Pass 1 ranked the candidates with y_lin predictions. Before the RD pass, every
+  //   prediction buffer the RD pass reads for the selected candidates is regenerated with the full model by repeating the pass-1
